---
/* L80 - the provider decision table, and the one column nobody can fill for you. */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="fig__frame">
    <img
      class="fig__picture"
      src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}illustrations/L80.jpg`}
      alt="A line drawing of a hand holding a pencil and ticking a small box in the first column of a ruled grid, with four filled squares running down the left edge."
    />
    <svg
      class="fig__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 340"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="L80-fig-title L80-fig-desc"
    >
      <title id="L80-fig-title">The provider decision table, and the column you have to go and measure</title>
      <desc id="L80-fig-desc">
        A four-row table, one row per candidate provider. The columns are provider,
        price per million tokens, image support, and the cost of 5 million tokens:
        clef-flash at 0.038 dollars and 0.19 dollars, jev at 0.042 and 0.21, clef at
        0.24 and 1.20, and an OpenAI-compatible gateway at 0.02 and 0.10. The last
        column, headed "measured on your tickets", reads "not measured yet" in every
        row, and a prussian line draws itself under that heading.
      </desc>

      <!-- header -->
      <text x="30" y="86" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" letter-spacing="0.09em" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">THE DECISION TABLE</text>
      <text x="30" y="112" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">provider</text>
      <text x="200" y="112" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">$/Mtok</text>
      <text x="270" y="112" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">images</text>
      <text x="330" y="112" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">5 Mtok</text>
      <text x="430" y="112" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-prussian)">measured on your tickets</text>
      <line x1="30" y1="124" x2="610" y2="124" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <line x1="418" y1="90" x2="418" y2="268" stroke="var(--color-rule-soft)" stroke-width="1" />

      <!-- rows -->
      <text x="30" y="152" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">clef:clef-flash</text>
      <text x="200" y="152" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">0.038</text>
      <text x="270" y="152" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">yes</text>
      <text x="330" y="152" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">$0.19</text>
      <text x="430" y="152" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">not measured yet</text>

      <text x="30" y="188" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">jev</text>
      <text x="200" y="188" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">0.042</text>
      <text x="270" y="188" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">no</text>
      <text x="330" y="188" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">$0.21</text>
      <text x="430" y="188" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">not measured yet</text>

      <text x="30" y="224" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">clef</text>
      <text x="200" y="224" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">0.24</text>
      <text x="270" y="224" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">yes</text>
      <text x="330" y="224" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">$1.20</text>
      <text x="430" y="224" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">not measured yet</text>

      <text x="30" y="260" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">oai</text>
      <text x="200" y="260" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">0.02</text>
      <text x="270" y="260" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">depends</text>
      <text x="330" y="260" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">$0.10</text>
      <text x="430" y="260" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">not measured yet</text>

      <!-- the one authored motion: the last column is the one that decides -->
      <path
        class="m-draw"
        style="--m-length: 180; --m-duration: 1.2s;"
        d="M 430 122 H 610"
        fill="none"
        stroke="var(--color-prussian)"
        stroke-width="1"
      />

      <!-- the decision, still unwritten -->
      <rect x="30" y="278" width="580" height="34" fill="var(--color-ground-deep)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="42" y="299" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">the decision, with the condition that would change it: still unwritten</text>

      <text x="30" y="330" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">5 Mtok = 10,000 tickets of 500 input tokens; prices are read from the code, not remembered</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="fig__caption">
    <span class="edge-code">figure L80</span>
    <span class="fig__caption-text">Four candidates and four columns you can fill from the code, and one column - measured on your own tickets - that decides the row.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  /* scoped to this figure */
  .fig__svg {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
</style>
